<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italian 10-yr BTP sale.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italian 10-yr BTP sale.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a third tranche of 4.0 trillion lire of 10-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (BTP) carrying a 6.75 percent coupon.</p>
<p>		     July 1, 2007     previous</p>
<p> Net Yield	   5.53 pct vs	5.91 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield	 6.38 pct vs	6.78 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price  103.40     vs    100.55</p>
<p> Bids		 7.042 trillion lire</p>
<p> Assigned	   4.000 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with a previous auction on June 27.</p>
</text>
